OL,3,GNEWSACascade of poppies an 'enormously
OL,4,Amoving' tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices have taken place across East
OL,7,FYorkshire and Lincolnshire to mark
OL,8,FRemembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FA military parade preceded the service
OL,11,Fin Hull at the city's Cenotaph.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, a ceremony was held at
OL,14,FLincoln Cathedral and featured a
OL,15,Fcascade of poppy petals that fell from
OL,16,Fthe rafters during a two-minute
OL,17,Fsilence.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
