OL,3,GNEWSACascade of poppies an 'enormously
OL,4,Amoving' tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Dean of Lincoln, Dr Simon Jones,
OL,7,Fsaid: "The silence in itself means a
OL,8,Fhuge amount, but then to accompany that
OL,9,Fwith the symbolism of those poppies
OL,10,Ffluttering to the ground is enormously
OL,11,Fmoving."
